=== 1. positional parameters and $0
in f: hello 2
b 3
0=pipeline_stage_state.sh 1=x
all: a b c
=== 2. $? of the command before the pipeline
status 1
brace 7
h sees 1 and arg
after true 0
bg 1
=== 3. $$ is the parent shell's pid
same $$
own $BASHPID
=== 4. set options
pipefail on
flags=fhB
default
=== 5. shopt flags
nullglob: (none)
extglob on
dotglob on
globstar off
defaults back
